    "speechPattern": "Soft, unhurried and exact, in whole sentences, the way someone speaks who is used to being listened to in a quiet room. She reaches for the language of the Order without preaching, and asks gentle questions that go straight to the point. When her own wants come near the surface she grows more formal, not less.",
